{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35838","headline":"山中夜坐寄故里友生 · 李咸用","name":"山中夜坐寄故里友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"展转檐前睡不成，一牀山月竹风清。\n虫声促促催乡梦，桂影高高挂旅情。\n祸福既能知倚伏，行藏争不要分明。\n可怜任永真坚白，净洗双眸看太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}